B.bjn=new A.e5("How do I submit a maintenance request?",'Tap the Maintenance tab at the bottom of the screen, then tap "Submit New Request." Describe the issue, select a category and priority level, and optionally add up to 5 photos. Tap Submit \u2014 your landlord will be notified immediately.')
B.bjp=new A.e5("What priority should I choose for my request?","Low: cosmetic or non-urgent issues that can wait weeks. Medium: issues affecting comfort but not safety (e.g., appliance not working). High: issues significantly affecting habitability (e.g., major leak, AC failure in summer). Emergency: immediate safety threats (e.g., gas leak, flooding, no heat in winter). Elevo does not send text messages. Contact your landlord directly in an emergency.")
B.bjb=new A.e5("How do I track the status of my request?","Each request shows a 4-stage progress bar: Submitted \u2192 Assigned \u2192 In Progress \u2192 Resolved. Tap any request to see full details including landlord notes and assigned vendor name. You'll receive a push notification whenever your landlord updates the status.")
