B.bje=new A.e5("How do I message my landlord?","Tap the Messages tab at the bottom of the screen to open a direct conversation with your landlord. You can send text messages and attach photos or files. You'll receive a push notification when your landlord replies.")
B.bjd=new A.e5("Can my landlord see all my messages?","Messages between you and your landlord are private to your conversation. No other tenants can see your messages. Elevo stores messages securely in Supabase with row-level security policies ensuring only you and your landlord can access your conversation.")
